The total summary of this hot update patch is as follows:
Game content
1. The character cutting gun system has been optimized, and now there should be no error in the firearm model. If it still occurs, please point it out in a timely manner;
2. Optimized the tactical actions of the characters, preventing them from getting stuck and avoiding targeting situations;
3. Fixed a small portion of zombie attributes;
4. The skin of the super modified weapon has been changed, and now the weapon skin will no longer be light polluted;
"Evil Spirit Freight Yard"
1. Now the zombies have become stronger;
2. Solved the problem of non skull formation;
3. Solved the situation where ammunition boxes cannot be filled with bullets;
Underground Facilities
1. Fixed the issue of zombies getting stuck at the door;
2. Fixed the issue where the task icon still exists after turning on the power;
3. Solved the problem of music overlay playback when charging the heart.
Dueling Ground Beta
1. Added decryption steps for unlocking weapons and transforming machines into super powerful ones, everyone can give it a try.

Solved the bug of weapon model errors during gun cutting;

Dueling Ground Beta
Added UI prompt for end of trial play

The total summary of this hot update patch is as follows:
Game content
1. Put the next free DLC map "Dueling Field" into the game as a trial version, and everyone can experience it first now;
2. Fixed the issue of no zombies appearing in round 37;
3. Fixed the error of not getting stuck in the game;
4. FOV settings have been added to the game settings, allowing players to adjust their game view;
Safe House
1. Add a guidance icon to the upgrade platform,
2. Solved the problem of incorrect display of guide icons;
Underground Facilities
1. Task guidance icons have been added, so players can now turn on the power and not get lost;
2. Set the difficulty of zombies to the lowest level, making it easier for everyone to solve puzzles;

